{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Which they acquired in the land of Canaan.</b> But what he acquired in Paddan-aram he gave entirely to Esav for his portion in the Cave of Machpelah. He said: property outside the Land is not worthwhile for me — and this is ״אֲשֶׁר כָּרִיתִי לִי״ — he set up for him piles of gold and silver like heaps, and said to him: take these."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:40.878364497Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}